    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_camera_heading">Why camera access is needed</string>
    <string name="privacy_camera_body">The camera permission is used only to show the live preview and to take the photograph or record the video when you press the shutter.</string>
    <string name="privacy_microphone_heading">Why microphone access is needed</string>
    <string name="privacy_microphone_body">The microphone is used only to record sound while you are recording a video. It is optional: deny it and videos record silently. Audio is never captured while taking photos or while the app is in the background.</string>
    <string name="privacy_location_heading">Why location access is needed</string>
    <string name="privacy_location_body">Your GPS position is read while the camera screen is open so the coordinates, accuracy, altitude and address can be written onto the photo.</string>
    <string name="privacy_storage_heading">How photos are stored</string>
    <string name="privacy_storage_body">Photos are written to Pictures/Geo Pin Cam on this device using the system media store, which makes them visible in your gallery app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_network_heading">Does data leave the device?</string>
    <string name="privacy_network_body">Your photos are never uploaded. Two features do send your coordinates off the device when you are online: converting coordinates into an address uses the Android geocoder, which may contact Google servers, and the map thumbnail requests a map tile from OpenStreetMap. Both are only ever given the coordinates, never the photo. Turn the map thumbnail off in Settings to stop the tile requests, and the app still stamps coordinates normally when offline.</string>
    <string name="privacy_analytics_heading">Analytics</string>
    <string name="privacy_analytics_body">This app contains no analytics, advertising or tracking libraries.</string>
    <string name="licenses_title">Open-source licenses</string>
    <string name="licenses_body">Geo Pin Cam is built with AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, CameraX and Google Play services Location, which are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

Map thumbnails use tile imagery © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License. See www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.</string>

